<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta content="Hey there, baking friends! 🍰 Frozen fruit is my go to when it comes to baking!   It’s always ready to use, available, budget friendly, and doesn’t go rotten when I forget to use it🤣🤦‍♀️🍓
Are you ready for a quick treat that'll dazzle your tastebuds and impress anyone who gets a bite? 
" property="og:description"/><meta content="5 Minute lemon and blueberry cake Recipe" property="og:title"/><meta content="website" property="og:type"/><meta content="https://app.samsungfood.com/recipes/107018a3052180271afa5138d3ead5f8c57" property="og:url"/><meta content="https://art.whisk.com/image/upload/fl_progressive,h_630,w_1200,c_fill/v1693027610/v3/user-recipes/ab85a2475db2153dcbe548fd5dfc6577.jpg" property="og:image"/><meta content="https://art.whisk.com/image/upload/fl_progressive,h_630,w_1200,c_fill/v1693027610/v3/user-recipes/ab85a2475db2153dcbe548fd5dfc6577.jpg" property="og:image:secure_url"/><meta property="og:image:alt"/><meta content="1200" property="og:image:width"/><meta content="630" property="og:image:height"/><meta content="en_US" property="og:locale"/><meta content="Samsung Food" property="og:site_name"/><link href="https://app.samsungfood.com/recipes/107018a3052180271afa5138d3ead5f8c57" rel="canonical"/><script type="application/ld+json">{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Recipe",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "- Zest from 2 fresh lemons",
    "- 1 cup sugar",
    "- Juice from 1 tantalizing lemon",
    "- 2 fluffy eggs",
    "- 1/2 cup velvety olive oil",
    "- 1/2 cup creamy yoghurt",
    "- 1.5 cups self raising flour (magic in a cup!)",
    "- 1.5 cup frozen blueberries (nature’s candy)",
    "- 1 tbsp raw sugar for that extra sparkle ✨"
  ],
  "name": "5 Minute lemon and blueberry cake",
  "description": "Hey there, baking friends! 🍰 Frozen fruit is my go to when it comes to baking!   It’s always ready to use, available, budget friendly, and doesn’t go rotten when I forget to use it🤣🤦‍♀️🍓\nAre you ready for a quick treat that'll dazzle your tastebuds and impress anyone who gets a bite? \n",
  "prepTime": "PT5M",
  "cookTime": "PT50M",
  "totalTime": "PT55M",
  "recipeYield": [
    10
  ],
  "image": "https://art.whisk.com/image/upload/fl_progressive,h_600,w_800,c_fill/v1693027610/v3/user-recipes/ab85a2475db2153dcbe548fd5dfc6577.jpg",
  "nutrition": {
    "@type": "NutritionInformation",
    "calories": "2820.87 calories",
    "carbohydrateContent": "389.06 g",
    "cholesterolContent": "343.29 mg",
    "fatContent": "129.8 g",
    "fiberContent": "12.74 g",
    "proteinContent": "35.13 g",
    "saturatedFatContent": "21.49 g",
    "sugarContent": "237.75 g",
    "transFatContent": "0.04 g",
    "servingSize": "10"
  },
  "recipeCategory": "Desserts",
  "recipeCuisine": "World Cuisine",
  "keywords": "5 Minute lemon and blueberry cake, Desserts, World Cuisine",
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToSection",
      "name": "",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "text": "1. In your trusty bowl, combine sugar, lemon zest, lemon juice, eggs, oil, and yogurt. Give it a good mix! 💪"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "text": "2. Add in 1 cup of those yummy frozen blueberries and the self-raising flour. Stir it up!"
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "text": "3. Pour that beautiful batter into a lined loaf tin."
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "text": "4. Decorate the top with the remaining blueberries and give it a sprinkle of raw sugar."
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "text": "5. Pop it in the oven at 160C and bake for a golden 50 minutes."
        },
        {
          "@type": "HowToStep",
          "text": "Voilà! A blueberry-lemon dream ready in no time. Perfect for last-minute parties or a cheeky weekend snack. Enjoy, and don't forget to share your masterpiece with me! 🎂📸"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
